    <briefdescription>
<para>A runtime render pass object that can begin a render pass. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>fixes a render pass shape and a framebuffer layout as specified in DSHL, as well as start/end actions, execution mode (true subpass reads or emulated T-register reads) and a debug name.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Survives device resets and best-efforts bindump reloads. If a pass or framebuffer changes or disappears after a reload, <ref refid="classShaderRenderPass_1_1Pass_1abd1020d696bc85a91aea887bd0250713" kindref="member">begin()</ref> is fatal until the instance is recreated. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
